{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf31 About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everything starts out beautiful.<br>The farm is in ruins. The pond is murky. The soil feels forgotten...<br>But there's still life here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a small piece of land you've inherited, you choose to begin again.<br>No rush. One step at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this calm and contemplative game, you will:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3e Restore old structures like greenhouses, barns, and planting fields</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc1f Clean and fish in waters that can be beautiful once more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf33 Unlock new areas by clearing paths and discovering useful resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddf9 Collect trash, care for the soil, and witness the land transform</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc34 Buy a horse and explore with freedom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcfb Restore the radio tower and catch the weather forecast, along with small ambient stories</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No deadlines. No pressure.</strong><br>Just you, time, and what grows when we care \u2014 slowly, patiently.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3878640?t=1753384060","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878640/36ea489af6667719f5d4ff9c49f917ebd2e4b10f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753384060","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878640/f37ba8dafb295113f0a87a8f1f7a87eb30321eed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753384060","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878640/f37ba8dafb295113f0a87a8f1f7a87eb30321eed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753384060","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"de